{"abstract":"In this chapter, we explore two distinct participatory research methodologies: Participatory Design and Action Research. While both approaches converge on shared participatory frameworks, principles, and values, Participatory Design integrates collaborative design elements into the research process.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Marttila, Sanna-Maria","Finken, Sisse"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-789570"],"filters":{"added":"2025-02","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"action research in participatory design","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/admin/files/105344102/The_Action_Research_Booklet_by_REFLACT.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-789570","ids":["itu-bb1491e8-ad02-43ae-831a-9cdee179a696"],"lang":"English","level":"Popular","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-2783C90EFD2A55E6CE8EF558BE07A50F"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/admin/files/105344102/The_Action_Research_Booklet_by_REFLACT.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Business IT","IT University of Copenhagen, Digitalization, Democracy, and Governance","IT University of Copenhagen, Digitalization, Democracy, and Governance, REFLACT"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Sanna-Maria","key":"marttilapau","last":"Marttila"