{"abstract":"In the last decade we have seen a rise of social media. Within this landscape of online services Facebook plays an immense role in facilitating and creating bonds between people. In this paper we enter a qualitative study conducted with a small group of adult Facebookers over 58. We do so in an effort to understand what kind of relationships one can have through this digital media. The theoretical lens used is Phenomenology, which we find fruitful for more carefully looking into relationships between humans and technology.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Pirli, Myrto","Finken, Sisse","Mörtberg, Christina"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-382924"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Embodiment","Facebookers","Older adults"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the embodiment of relationships of adult facebookers","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/82451870/The_embodiment_of_relationships_of_adult_Facebookers_for_Sisse.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-382924","identifier":[{"id":"84984975998","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-6efff1f4-cb5c-4f42-b281-9ad35144f509"],"keyword":["Embodiment","Facebookers","Older adults"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-3BDE0AECA78DF949B7A4C7FE0EF32FEB"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/82451870/The_embodiment_of_relationships_of_adult_Facebookers_for_Sisse.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhage